{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうも、ラピートです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/05/19/0476528/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後PのPは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラピートのピー(？)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラピートってあれですね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"剣道川後的な要素ありますね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんがいラピート似でびっくりしました、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなさん、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個性的なのありがとうございます、、笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/05/19/0476528/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は先日、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元・長崎に帰ってました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の暑い時期に帰ったので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい久しぶり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しだったので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は家族だけで過ごしました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観光したよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも帰ったらいくココウォーク"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(長崎のおっきいショッピングモール)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にいってご飯食べて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたりをお散歩しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オランダ坂もいったよ～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/05/19/0476528/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レンガがきれいだったのでパシャり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服は、シンプル。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/05/19/0476528/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お散歩日和で凄く楽しかったよ◯。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/05/19/0476528/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"締め切りも近づいてきたのと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近知った！という方がいたので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう一度Popteenのお話を、、！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現在発売中のPopteen6月号で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現役Popteenモデルの前田希美さんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コーデバトル企画を行っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が勝てば専属モデルになれる、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というものです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくいただく質問を答えます！>_<"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◯どうやって投票するの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうやるのかは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Popteen6月号に一冊一枚ついている"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"巻末アンケートでどちらか可愛いと思ったほうに丸をつけるところがあるので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこに丸をつけたら投票することができます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その丸の数で勝敗は決まります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◯アンケートで答えれないところはどうしたらいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"投票の際、アンケートは答えられる範囲で答えて頂ければ大丈夫です。とのことです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので安心してください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◯複数送っても大丈夫なの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"複数投票は可能です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですが、もしも一緒の封筒に入れて送るときは切手代に注意してね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"重さによって違うから(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◯締め切りはいつまでなの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月5月31日(当日消印有効)です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしポストに投函する場合は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早めに29日とかには送ったほうが安心かも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◯結果はいつ分かるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8月1日発売の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Popteen9月号で発表されるよ>_<♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という感じです。>_<"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発表されるまで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう毎日ドキドキです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こわい～、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんがついているんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思うと心強いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人じゃないんだって思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーも友達も、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてファンの人がついてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの愛をほんと毎日実感(ﾉ_･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/05/19/0476528/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〇お知らせ〇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モデルプレスさんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"取材していただきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/05/19/0476528/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしの思いをいっぱい語りました｡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あまり答えてこなかった部分"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言ってなかったことをたくさんお話！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真もとってもらったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもモデルプレスを読んでるんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくモデルさんがモデルプレスってロゴの前で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真を撮ってるのあるからなんだか嬉しかった～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜったい見てね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://mdpr.jp/interview/1487461"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モデルプレスさんの公式vine"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","